<title>ARGENTINA: Oil Industry Forum meeting in Argentina.</title>
<headline>Oil Industry Forum meeting in Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Oil Industry International Exploration and Production Forum will hold its annual meeting in Buenos Aires on Friday, hosts Shell Argentina said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The association has 59 members, including the world's major oil and natural gas companies.</p>
<p>The forum was founded in 1974 as an international lobby. After the meeting, those attending will participate in a seminar on sustainable development.</p>
<p>-- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
